host_about:
We love creating warm, design-focused spaces filled with art, texture, and thoughtful details. Many of the pieces throughout the apartment are created by Rachel or by talented local artists and friends.
If you'd like to see more of Rachel’s artwork and weaving projects, you can follow
@mrblueskye or @everwovenflowers

